//=========================================================================
// HZM coop - LADDER STATE HOOK                          [user 2026-08-05] bug-1415
//
// Called from player_Torso.st entrycommands, exactly the way the ladder-spawning mod's
// legs_movement.scr is (github.com/mohaa-moddb/ladder-spawning-mod):
//
//     state GET_ON_LADDER / LATCH_ONTO_LADDER   -> exec coop_mod/ladder_state.scr "ON_LADDER"
//     state FINISHED_GET_OFF_LADDER / JUMP_OFF_LADDER -> exec coop_mod/ladder_state.scr "OFF_LADDER"
//
// self = the player (statemap execs run on the owning player). The flag is what
// ladder.scr::status_check watches to know the climb ended - the statemap is the ONLY thing that
// truly knows, because it is what drives the climbwall movetype.
//
// Kept as its own tiny file, mirroring the source mod's separation, so the .st exec line stays
// byte-simple - .st parse errors ERR_DROP the server (project trap list).
//=========================================================================
main local.state:{
	if( local.state == "ON_LADDER" ){
		self.legs_state_using_ladder = 1
	}
	else if( local.state == "OFF_LADDER" ){
		self.legs_state_using_ladder = 0
	}
}end
